  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Who Knows** (1 other source): Who Knows leads into a drum section, which then returns to Jesus Children [2]\n- **Jesus Children** (1 other source): Jesus Children flows straight into Who Knows, per the track listing [1]\n- **Lenny** (1 other source): Lenny segues directly into the closing So Live! [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **The World is a Ghetto**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **call for encore**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2001-06-15.at822.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 14 songs; 112 min [1]\n- **soulive2001-06-15.shnf**: matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 13 songs; 120 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Crowd noise is marked on the tracklist between The World is a Ghetto and Lenny [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2001-06-15.at822.flac16**: taped by DaveC; transferred by BradM; source: AT822 > Sony MD [1]. Also: DaveC taped the show; BradM transferred the discs and uploaded it [1]\n- **soulive2001-06-15.shnf**: taped by Blane Harvey; transferred by Jason Sobel; source: Matrix: (On Stage) Schoeps cmc621 & SBD (45/55 mix)->Behringer MX-802A->Sony D8 @ 44.1khz [2]",
